    {
      "id": "u_796c878b424feb3a6bbdb6af_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This page contains instructions on how to set up __TRILIUM_PH_0__Signing in with OpenID Connect__TRILIUM_PH_1__ with various providers such as Authelia, GitLab, Google.",
      "sourceHash": "796c878b424feb3a6bbdb6af9cb7553184d43194e7e06922f2029f9cf1f043f4",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d278054efde3c17f374c027c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "While the configuration reference is correct and up to date, the steps to create the OAuth application might differ slightly as providers change their UI.",
      "sourceHash": "d278054efde3c17f374c027c8c9a412de57da89b67b86ce93d4aa53567400247",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7f86ddb23ef1c5cae094e646_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Authelia",
      "sourceHash": "7f86ddb23ef1c5cae094e64640d6585ad4cce523e870890dfd9d536971a08edc",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
