      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6c3f71167949ee77ffa2b911_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Generate a client secret:",
      "sourceHash": "6c3f71167949ee77ffa2b911cfc1c733f8e6d3a7e335f0118efffa77894d8e69",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c094cfc42ece07c08fea2e77_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ goes to Trilium, __TRILIUM_PH_1__ (the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ string) goes to Authelia.",
      "sourceHash": "c094cfc42ece07c08fea2e775cc5cab2a92dc38828f2eed7164de31d79600c35",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8dfa0cd3aed9dd0ad1738655_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Add a client under __TRILIUM_PH_0__ in Authelia's __TRILIUM_PH_1__, replacing __TRILIUM_PH_2__ with the URL of your Trilium instance:",
      "sourceHash": "8dfa0cd3aed9dd0ad17386559f9db0e20661fd60a007fbe562a69bc14d608cf7",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_78cc76e89d32ec8dcbc05d53_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike GitLab, __TRILIUM_PH_0__ is a name you choose rather than one the provider generates.",
      "sourceHash": "78cc76e89d32ec8dcbc05d538e0c56cd644d8f8cae82e71cf567e3ca144f44d2",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_88995f129b8fd64678ada5fe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Restart Authelia.",
      "sourceHash": "88995f129b8fd64678ada5fe24415b4f35adb79c383d2e5bdb74ce9f4d8d9a10",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4a255792f68ce2dab40b38e1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Adjust __TRILIUM_PH_0__, using the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ from step 1:",
      "sourceHash": "4a255792f68ce2dab40b38e17e5c157ecce05f1ddc3750a25241da323ad6bc01",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1e350e22c07aeab52b11d44a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Do __TRILIUM_PH_0__not__TRILIUM_PH_1__ set __TRILIUM_PH_2__ for Authelia. It defaults confidential clients to __TRILIUM_PH_3__ and rejects any other method with __TRILIUM_PH_4__, which is the default Trilium already uses. This is the opposite of the GitLab case below.",
      "sourceHash": "1e350e22c07aeab52b11d44abbc166f068fb6f208fd30f092189b12541adc647",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8d2e4a7bf60c5fce2df5b84_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ GitLab",
      "sourceHash": "a8d2e4a7bf60c5fce2df5b84044bd969cfa14ecd932e9ff2d8625821fb5c8ad4",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_eef7ca8f512e4b9e1f0b0f2e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Go to user settings on __TRILIUM_PH_0__gitlab.com__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or your own self-hosted instance.",
      "sourceHash": "eef7ca8f512e4b9e1f0b0f2e1fb0a06acad7f6f1285dbc09463902cab1ad85cc",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_42ccaae2bbedafca9e8aabfa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add new application__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "42ccaae2bbedafca9e8aabfaff175b4d663f10722278293abc1bb59db342f6a8",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3f4e23dfa65b07d74e7d212d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Give it a name (e.g. Trilium).",
      "sourceHash": "3f4e23dfa65b07d74e7d212d128140ad6fbf27b2cda88d3d4f4cb300a3d51a82",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cf7f9b26830eef9a82734cb6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Set __TRILIUM_PH_0__Redirect URI__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to __TRILIUM_PH_2__",
      "sourceHash": "cf7f9b26830eef9a82734cb6ea8343a728d6d264bbbeeb920dec25095f1cd43a",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3e6f4c82c1e7b19ef7f850fa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Make sure __TRILIUM_PH_0__Confidential__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is checked and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Device authorization grant__TRILIUM_PH_3__ is unchecked.",
      "sourceHash": "3e6f4c82c1e7b19ef7f850fa48eb743a0cd995084e0c0910ae646b7e2b6dcf5e",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Confidential__TRILIUM_PH_1__ にチェックが入っており、__TRILIUM_PH_2__Device authorization grant__TRILIUM_PH_3__ のチェックが外されていることを確認してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d641a6cc13ee1b06e6f34ad_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Under scopes, check __TRILIUM_PH_0__openid__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__profile__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__email__TRILIUM_PH_5__ (they should be near the end).",
      "sourceHash": "9d641a6cc13ee1b06e6f34ad267b37a998a6a0276cf8db026f041f708cee5ad6",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "スコープ（Scopes）の下にある __TRILIUM_PH_0__openid__TRILIUM_PH_1__、__TRILIUM_PH_2__profile__TRILIUM_PH_3__、__TRILIUM_PH_4__email__TRILIUM_PH_5__ にチェックを入れます（通常、リストの終盤にあります）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_49156c2674670116a176eab2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Save the application and copy the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Application ID__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Secret__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "49156c2674670116a176eab2bfc77d444497564033f755142770b4161c14e1f5",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "アプリケーションを保存し、__TRILIUM_PH_0__Application ID__TRILIUM_PH_1__ と __TRILIUM_PH_2__Secret__TRILIUM_PH_3__ をコピーします。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fa41bfc34e48d1181f64640f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Adjust __TRILIUM_PH_0__ as follows, replacing __TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__ with the values from the last step as well as the __TRILIUM_PH_3__ with a URL to your Trilium instance.",
      "sourceHash": "fa41bfc34e48d1181f64640f3b16b9c4d7752c25b09a5095f9c7af66efb4208b",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ を次のように調整します。__TRILIUM_PH_1__ と __TRILIUM_PH_2__ には前の手順の値を使用し、__TRILIUM_PH_3__ にはご自身の Trilium インスタンスの URL を指定します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a87793174308160111a7b4a1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you are using a self-hosted instance of GitLab, make sure to also update __TRILIUM_PH_0__, and keep the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ line above.",
      "sourceHash": "a87793174308160111a7b4a13ef3afba3fa737ebfa04e753ea2eb03729cd8160",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "セルフホスト版の GitLab を使用している場合は、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ も必ず更新し、上記の __TRILIUM_PH_1__ 行を維持してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_69ec290769b8cf1e85598728_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "GitLab's token endpoint does not decode credentials sent via HTTP Basic, so without __TRILIUM_PH_0__, sign-in fails with a __TRILIUM_PH_1__ error. Trilium applies this automatically for __TRILIUM_PH_2__, but a self-hosted issuer URL cannot be detected.",
      "sourceHash": "69ec290769b8cf1e85598728be74b361700d53137198df872ae26f47b7bece81",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "GitLab のトークンエンドポイントは HTTP Basic で送信された資格情報をデコードしないため、__TRILIUM_PH_0__ がないとサインインが __TRILIUM_PH_1__ エラーで失敗します。Trilium は __TRILIUM_PH_2__ に対してこれを自動的に適用しますが、セルフホストの発行者 URL は検出できません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9c70c3a1abf730d0bbf54e7d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Kanidm",
      "sourceHash": "9c70c3a1abf730d0bbf54e7d6d3103a6ebe6c9945ab000ffd57be5a4857b40e1",
