    },
    {
      "id": "u_9627d424821d9349499c2580_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Create the client, add the redirect URL and grant the scopes, replacing __TRILIUM_PH_0__ with the URL of your Trilium instance and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ with an existing Kanidm group whose members may sign in:",
      "sourceHash": "9627d424821d9349499c2580b743d71e33003929ed794b8efad37f1924d0b45e",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "クライアントを作成し、リダイレクト URL を追加してスコープを付与します。__TRILIUM_PH_0__ はお使いの Trilium インスタンスの URL に、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ はサインインが許可されるメンバーを含む既存の Kanidm グループに置き換えてください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a2284de67fc7ad3870884006_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ scope is mandatory; without it Kanidm treats the client as plain OAuth 2.0.",
      "sourceHash": "a2284de67fc7ad38708840068f4c020a4f684604337e24a3768ec373f17da346",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ スコープは必須です。これがないと、Kanidm はクライアントを通常の OAuth 2.0 として扱います。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c17b643cf7580fb3c90a74d3_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Read the client secret:",
      "sourceHash": "c17b643cf7580fb3c90a74d3dd162826836e4ab46aeeafbe688eb459d28abfa1",
