    },
    {
      "id": "u_a1301ad219c1b25f4fc351a0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Adjust __TRILIUM_PH_0__ as follows, replacing __TRILIUM_PH_1__ with the URL of your Kanidm instance and __TRILIUM_PH_2__ with the value from step 2:",
      "sourceHash": "a1301ad219c1b25f4fc351a0603405187ae521ca5906482a10ea82acd343a7dd",
      "context": "Setting up with various providers",
      "contextHash": "aed08d32912b31afd0bf72269d029e5f61b7e7e28478d8173d1d5b12d597f744",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ を次のように調整します。__TRILIUM_PH_1__ には Kanidm インスタンスの URL を、__TRILIUM_PH_2__ にはステップ 2 の値を指定します。",
