      "id": "u_f24b0d686dd4da4537585435_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Pocket ID is passwordless, signing in requires a passkey. Register one and confirm you can sign in to Pocket ID itself __TRILIUM_PH_0__before__TRILIUM_PH_1__ switching Trilium over to OpenID Connect, otherwise you may find yourself unable to authenticate at either end.",
